[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Nice to Meet You.]
[00:00.70]Lesson 5 | 第5课
[00:02.08]Nice to meet you. | 很高兴认识你。
[00:04.54]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:09.52]Is Chang-woo Chinese? | 昌宇是中国人吗？
[00:13.41]Good morning. | 早上好。
[00:15.62]Good morning Mr. Blake. | 布莱克先生，早上好。
[00:19.21]This is Miss Sophie Dupont. | 这是索菲·杜邦小姐。
[00:23.26]Sophie is a new student. | 索菲是新学生。
[00:26.36]She is French. | 她是法国人。
[00:28.62]Sophie this is Hans. | 索菲，这是汉斯。
[00:32.34]He is German. | 他是德国人。
[00:34.34]Nice to meet you. | 很高兴认识你。
[00:36.94]And this is Naoko. | 这是直子。
[00:39.76]She's Japanese. | 她是日本人。
[00:42.02]Nice to meet you. | 很高兴认识你。
[00:44.18]And this is Chang-woo. | 这是昌宇。
[00:47.08]He's Korean. | 他是韩国人。
[00:48.99]Nice to meet you. | 很高兴认识你。
[00:51.16]She is Chinese too. | 她也是中国人。
[01:04.02]Nice to meet you. | 很高兴认识你。